Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁在乎啊  我在乎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, who cares? I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也在乎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And so do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要和她谈谈   让我换件衣服好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what, I have to talk to her. Will you let me just get changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊   没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你看我换衣服吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Am I going to let you watch me undress?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:14:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信她竟然如此   她就是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe her. It's just so typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我知道你不高兴  可别忘了要举行婚礼了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now Monica, I know you're upset, but don't forget there is going to be a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会去丢花   然后去蜜月\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are going to throw the bouquet, and then a honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能去巴黎   巴黎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe in Paris. Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会在月光下的   那叫什么来着的大道上散步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We will take a moonlit walk on the Rue de la blah-blah-blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会在床上洒些玫瑰花瓣   然后做爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then we will sprinkle rose petals on the bed and make love...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是因为那样很浪漫   而是因为我能做到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...not just because it's romantic, but because I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说话   你会把它吓跑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, don't say anything, you might scare it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是巴黎   谁知道我们在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Paris. Who knows we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Pheebs. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说我可以在你的婚礼上演唱   所以我要收订金\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You said I could sing at your wedding, so I need a small deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你知道  需要用一笔钱来预定那个日期\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Y'know, just some good faith money to hold the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会给你订金\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not giving you a deposit for our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们真能伤你的心  不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They break your heart, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.01,0:16:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要他们的同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I don't really need their permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想在他们婚礼上唱歌  就在他们婚礼上唱歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! if you wanna sing at their wedding, well you sing at their wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想看起来像19岁  就要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and if you want to look 19, then you--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要修饰一下你的眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got to do something about your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么   我的眼睛怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?! What's wrong with my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们出卖了你   出卖了里面太多的智慧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They give you away. There's just-there's just too much wisdom in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在上面放茶袋敷15分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just put some tea bags on them for 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个也会去除我的智慧  也许你只需要10分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That'll get rid of my wisdom? Maybe 10 minutes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给她订金  给她戒指   我不在乎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, give her the deposit, give her the ring. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事   摩妮卡  你是什么意思  你说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes? Monica, What did you mean when you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不想和任何人谈  尤其是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you didn't want to talk to anyone, especially me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒的道歉  你接受了  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What a great apology. And you accept it. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.77,0:17:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是认真的 "特别是和我"  是怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No-no, seriously-seriously, what was the "especially me" part about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样说吧   这不是你第一次抢了我的风头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let's just say it's not the first time you've stolen my thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wham'?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, here's a thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你在说什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我16岁的生日宴会上  记得你和我表哥查理上三垒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My sweet 16. Remember, you went to third base with my cousin Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊  上三垒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, third base.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都在讲那件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was all everybody at the party could talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  那会儿发生是因为你的宴会太无聊了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, y'know what? The only reason I did that was because your party was so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们请了一个漫画家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We had a caricaturist. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我结婚时  猜猜不会请谁来演唱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whenever I get married Guess who won't be asked to sing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫盖勒的还有叫宾的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Somebody named Geller And somebody else named Bing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你的甜蜜16岁生日就像是一百万年前的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, your sweet 16 was like a million years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你现在又再做了一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And yet, here we are doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想抢你的所谓的风头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, Monica I don't want to steal your stupid thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:18:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那还有什么原因   你会和罗斯亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why else would you have made out with Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.45,0:18:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了啦   时机已过  不会发生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, easy mimey, the moment has passed. It ain't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果今晚的注意力都在我身上就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just thought it would be nice if I could have this one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓  我从没有想要过抢你的风头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I swear, I never wanted any part of your night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不应该有人看到我们接吻的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No one was supposed to see us kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们就在秘密走廊上做吧  因为没有人会到那儿去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, is that why you did it the secret hallway where nobody ever goes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我想过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Rachel, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们今晚在一起的主意不是很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think us getting together tonight is such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想退出了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm calling it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.31,0:18:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是挽救尊严的好方法啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Way to save your dignity, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我为什么要抢走属于你的晚上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mon, why, why would I ever want to take away from your night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  也许你有一点生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know, maybe you feel a little resentful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你以为你会先结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you thought you'd get married first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你不能忍耐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you can't stand...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那个以前很胖的朋友会先结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that your formerly fat friend is getting married first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  你知道吗  太不公平了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wow, that-You know what? That is so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  现在我想抢你风头了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? Now I want to steal your thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:19:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  走  我们做爱去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Ross. Let's go have sex!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信  你们竟然在我的订婚之夜做爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you're gonna have sex on my engagement night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人做啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, somebody should.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.15,0:19:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们要做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, if we're gonna do this--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能做  只是让她以为我们有做过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not gonna do this, all right? She's just gonna think that we're doin’it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了  人人都是赢家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I see, so everybody wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁  是摩妮卡  开门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who is it? It's Monica, open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  停一下  拜托   等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Ross, stop it. Please, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  你喜欢吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you like that, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}May we help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要告诉你  我希望你们能上床  希望你们复合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted to say I hope you do have sex tonight and I hope you get back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我警告你啊   你宣布订婚的那一晚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I must warn you, the night you announce your engagement...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会宣布我怀孕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm going to announce that I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么可能呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How is that ever going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你想知道今晚   我为什么会和罗斯在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right Monica, do you want to know why I was with Ross tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道为什么   你不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know why. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.49,0:20:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  为什么   因为我很伤心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, why? Because! Because I was sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我很\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I am so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很为你们高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so happy for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你要结婚这件事   提醒了我   我没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you getting married just reminds me of the fact that I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八字都没一撇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我只想让自己好过一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I don't know, maybe I just wanted to make myself feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这很笨  可是罗斯结婚时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know that that's dumb, but you were so depressed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你沮丧得和钱德上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...when Ross got married, you slept with Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无所谓   和她上床的是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't care, she slept with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.11,0:20:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  很抱歉   毁了属于你的今晚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, sweetie, I am so sorry I ruined your night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉   我几乎让你和罗斯上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry I almost made you sleep with Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.87,0:20:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations, man. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:20:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Rachel. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能说什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你失去了你的机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You missed your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从现在起  只有我能享受他们了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}From now on, the only person who's going to enjoy these bad boys is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为菲比会离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We thought Phoebe would leave
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她留了下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But she just stayed and stayed
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我整夜留在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right, I'm here all night
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德永远不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Chandler will never get--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  这儿是一块钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, here's a dollar.
